tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unstable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Unstable}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\n\\exists X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ [v_X(\\varphi)\\ne v_Y(\\varphi)],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Unstable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Unstable}_J(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对句子且固定点类非空时，这恰是同值稳定性的否定。它是固定点选择依赖，未断言一条修正序列随时间振荡。\n说谎者与真理陈述者分别给出稳定间隙、可变赋值的两个例子。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.1，印刷页 196–197，PDF 页 207–208（局部分类缩写）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)$、$v_X$、$\\mathrm{Stable}_J$ 采用 [[91-df-stable-sentence]] 的同一非空固定点类。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"v_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unstable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Unstable}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\n\\exists X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\ [v_X(\\varphi)\\ne v_Y(\\varphi)],\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Unstable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Unstable}_J(\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1132,"backlinks":[{"id":"525f810b84880b72","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-unstable-sentence]